Forgotten Battle Part 1 (date of ascension: some months in the past)

Lau the Neutral monk made it. The game was fairly
"normal" before I encountered a polymorphed nalfeshnee
in the mine-end. I can't remember how I got around killing it
with a low-level charecter, but I know that I had to escape
a couple of times at least.

I got polymorphed in the Mines and thus played a short
time as an Arch-Lich (what a great thing a =oPC is).

I found a figurine of a lich early in the game. I managed to
train it into an arch-lich, which decimated everything in
it's path. I did train my martial arts skill into Grand Master,
but used sword (Vorpy, basically) in the late game.
Before Medusa I got a wish and used it on a CoMR. A lamp
wish failed after that. Later I found a shield of reflection.

I received marvellous gifts first two gifts: Giantslayer
and Trollsbane. Whee. I did got Mojo later.

I dumped the lich (Luiz Cannibal) in some level
before entering the Plane of Earth.
(Cookie for those who identify the comic reference)

